  "description": "Adventurer 'Benzak' hides in a cave with a map, his grandfather's heirloom, in search of the 'most beautiful treasure'. However, a more dazzling and beautiful being than the treasure,'Rhys', was waiting in the cave.\n\n*\"You've finally come to keep your promise with me?\"*\n\nRhys soon reveals his gigantic figure along with unknown words...\n\n(Source: Mr. Blue, translated)\n\n *Note: Chapters 1 to 4 were originally published as part of the anthology Seongbidan Tteokdae-Kung! S2 (성비단 떡대-쿵!★ S2), while the 3 side story chapters were included in Seongbidan Inoetammi (성비단 인외탐미).*",
